<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Land to launch property project.</title>
<headline>Keppel Land to launch property project.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Land Ltd, part of the Keppel Corp group, said Wednesday it plans to launch its condominium project in the northern part of Singapore on the Good Friday holiday.</p>
<p>The Palm Gardens project at Choa Chu Kang will be priced at an average of Singapore $580 per sq foot.</p>
<p>Keppel Land said it will offer 384 units in the initial phase of the launch. It will also be paying stamp duty for potential buyers.</p>
<p>Analysts said the pricing of the project was very much in line with the current soft market conditions.  </p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
